      "purpose": "Inputs bind exact field identities."
    }
  ],
  "prose": {
    "summary": "Define schema-driven input primitives for text, number, boolean, enum/select, date/time and structured values, keeping edit buffers separate from accepted canonical state.",
    "notes": [
